A1 L2: on the regenerated Stillsand site (baroque_wave0 tier, all five DLC), RM_StillsandTraderProbe.Report runs the engine's own predicates (IncidentWorker_TraderCaravanArrival.FactionCanBeGroupSource, PawnGroupMaker.CanGenerateFrom against the tile biome's allowedPackAnimals, RCellFinder.TryFindRandomPawnEntryCell) and reports at least one faction that is a group source with a Trader group generable on RM_Stillsand, so vanilla TraderCaravanArrival is no longer refused there.
